      "text": "[6:09PM] #Vi #TrafficUpdate \n\nThe current traffic situation in V.i indicates a steady movement of vehicles towards McWen Bridge.\nHowever, a notable backlog has developed, extending to Ahmadu Bello Way and Ozumba Mbadiwe via Bonny Camp Roundabout, primarily due to the peak hour rush and traffic alternation.\n\nFortunately, no impediments have been reported at this time, and our dedicated officers are actively managing the situation on ground to ensure a smooth and uninterrupted flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
