      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1929952361960878592",
      "text": "[6:11PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow from UBA Roundabout to NNPC Filling Station and from Cathedral Church to Nitel Intersection.\nGood movement observed from State House to Mcwen Bridge and connecting Force Road.\nFast-moving traffic reported from Zone 2 Underneath Bridge to Flagstaff House and inward towards Mekwen Bridge.\nFavorable traffic conditions on the stretch from Onikan Roundabout to TBS and inward towards Water Board, connecting Nitel Intersection.\nUnimpeded movement along the entire Broad Street axis, including from General Hospital to Tinubu Square and connecting Abibu Oki Street via Martins Junction.\nSlow and steady traffic approaching Davies Street due to commercial activities.\nEfficient movement on Igbosere Road and Catholic Mission Street, connecting Ganiu Smith Street.\n\nOfficers are actively managing the situation to maintain a smooth flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
